    "What is your relationship with mathematics?": "Mathematics feels like a bridge between abstract reasoning and real-world logic for me—though I’m not deeply passionate about it personally, its structured problem-solving keeps engaging my analytical mind. My vocational training and occasional work in logistics require quick calculations, so I’ve retained some practical utility. It’s more of a tool than a passion.",
